  "description": "CR 712.11a, 715.3a, 715.2b, 715.3c, 715.4, 701.14a, 115.4, 400.7, 712.11, 602.5d, 307.1: Clive, Ifrit's Dominant, tapping, exiles itself and returns transformed only as a sorcery; Ifrit, a creature Saga back face, enters with a lore counter and its chapter I fights up to one other creature; chapter II adds RRRR and stays, chapter III adds RRRR and returns the card front face up as a new Clive",
  "note": "Turn 1: Clive starts tapped, so its {T} activation is refused. Turn 4: with alice's Shock on the stack the activation is refused again; after it resolves, Ifrit arrives with one lore counter, so chapter I triggers; Ifrit itself is refused as the target and it fights bob's Craw Wurm, killing it and taking 6. Turn 7: the second lore counter adds four red, and with two counters Ifrit stays. Turn 10: the third adds four red, and with three counters Ifrit is exiled and returns as Clive with no lore counters (not sacrificed by CR 715.4 while chapter III is on the stack). The new Clive's enters trigger is declined, so the hand alice drew on turns 4, 7 and 10 (Volcanic Hammer, Lava Axe, Llanowar Elves) stays and Lightning Bolt stays on top. The stack view names Ifrit's chapter triggers by the card's front-face name, as the runner names every unlabelled source.",
